# docs/design/45-web-platform.md, docs/compiler/codegen.md §16: `BrowserNotifications` is the
# notifications chunk's, which only an app whose client notifies ships, and only with the pages
# that reach it (`Home`, not `Report`); the container binds `Notifications` to it with no `use`
# rule, passing the pages' `href`, and the build emits the service worker that shows them at the
# site's root (`root`). Nothing here encodes a page, so there is no `Page$codec`.
